  "definition": "A systematic method applied to improve computational performance, memory efficiency, or rendering throughput in metaverse and spatial computing infrastructure. Optimisation techniques span algorithmic improvements (level-of-detail, culling, compression), hardware utilisation strategies (GPU parallelism, cache coherence), and software-level approaches (batching, shader optimisation) that collectively reduce latency and resource consumption.",
